&lt;p data-start=&quot;518&quot; data-end=&quot;653&quot;&gt;Global Marts builds the technology behind DoorDash&#39;s own grocery and retail operations across DashMart, Wolt Market, and Deliveroo Hop.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;655&quot; data-end=&quot;829&quot;&gt;Our systems decide what products our stores stock, how much inventory to purchase, which vendors to source from, how warehouses execute orders, and what prices customers see.&lt;/p&gt;
