&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own the full domain: strategy, roadmap, and the engineering org that builds it, working closely and collaboratively with globally distributed teams across multiple time zones, and reporting into senior leadership. This isn&#39;t a narrow platform mandate. It spans product and engineering together, with the scop

